  "description": "Invoke editorial sophistication, vintage boutique romance, and high-fashion elegance with Mangut! Styled as a Modern Font Serif, Mangut features dramatic contrast between slender stems and bold, sweeping fluid curves, crowned with ornate teardrop serifs and graceful calligraphic loops. Its commanding, high-contrast posture delivers an instant aura of luxury prestige, artistic moodiness, and timeless beauty across display headers. Ideal for high-end fashion branding, editorial magazine titles, boutique product packaging, luxury logo designs, wedding stationery, quote art prints, and custom Cricut or Silhouette craft SVG projects!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Invoke editorial sophistication, vintage boutique romance, and high-fashion elegance with Mangut! Styled as a Modern Font Serif, Mangut features dramatic contrast between slender stems and bold, sweeping fluid curves, crowned with ornate teardrop serifs and graceful calligraphic loops. Its commanding, high-contrast posture delivers an instant aura of luxury prestige, artistic moodiness, and timeless beauty across display headers. Ideal for high-end fashion branding, editorial magazine titles, boutique product packaging, luxury logo designs, wedding stationery, quote art prints, and custom Cricut or Silhouette craft SVG projects!</p>",
